### Tool Calling: 获取当前北京时间
POST http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/conversation/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "message": "现在北京时间几点？请说明你是否使用了工具。",
  "history": []
}

### Skill: 生成 Spring AI Alibaba 学习建议
POST http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/conversation/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "message": "我是初学者，下一步应该怎么学习 Spring AI Alibaba Agent 和 Tool Calling？请给出 Markdown 列表。",
  "history": []
}

### Skill: 生成今日 30 分钟学习计划
POST http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/conversation/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "message": "请给我一个今天 30 分钟的 Spring AI Alibaba Tool Calling 学习计划。",
  "history": []
}

### Skill: 解释概念
POST http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/conversation/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "message": "请用初学者能懂的话解释 Tool、Skill、Agent、Graph 的区别。",
